# Bounded q2331 shader parameter-name propagation review

Fresh source-only review by `/root/verifier_scope`, pinned to product revision
`95e63628f9d70b8dd6e6fede64334696c6995009`. It does not close a whole lens or
make a ledger/count decision. WGSL and macro-bearing Rust were inspected only
as text. No shader, parser, macro, product code, fixture, build, test, renderer,
GPU operation, runtime probe, implementation or repair was executed.

